<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Task Detail</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>

<body>
  <div class="page">

    <%- include('partials/header') %>
      <p class="page-subtitle">Task Detail</p>

      <div class="detail-layout">
        <section class="task-detail-card">
          <div class="detail-header">
            <h2>
              <%= task.title %>
            </h2>

            <p><strong>Status:</strong>
              <%= task.status %>
            </p>
            <p><strong>Assignee:</strong>
              <%= task.assignee %>
            </p>
            <p><strong>Deadline:</strong>
              <%= task.deadline %>
            </p>
            <p><strong>Priority:</strong>
              <%= task.priority %>
            </p>
            <span class="priority medium">Medium</span>
          </div>

          <div class="detail-info">
            <p><strong>Status:</strong> In Progress</p>
            <p><strong>Assignee:</strong> Nhữ Văn Tuấn</p>
            <p><strong>Role:</strong> Team Leader</p>
            <p><strong>Deadline:</strong> 2026-04-12</p>
            <p><strong>Project:</strong> TaskFlow – Mini Trello</p>
          </div>

          <div class="detail-description">
            <h3>Description</h3>
            <p>
              Build the dashboard interface for the TaskFlow project, including
              summary statistic cards, kanban columns, task cards, and a clean
              layout for team task management.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="detail-actions">
            <a href="/task/<%= task.id %>/edit" class="btn-primary">Edit Task</a>
            <a href="/dashboard" class="back-link">← Back to board</a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="comment-section">
          <h3>Comments</h3>

          <div class="comment-list">
            <div class="comment-item">
              <p class="comment-author">Nguyễn Xuân Tùng</p>
              <p class="comment-text">
                I finished the initial dashboard layout and basic kanban UI.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="comment-item">
              <p class="comment-author">Nguyễn Hữu Trí</p>
              <p class="comment-text">
                Please keep the task detail page consistent with the dashboard style.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="comment-item">
              <p class="comment-author">Nguyễn Văn Linh</p>
              <p class="comment-text">
                We should improve the member information and highlight the leader.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <form class="comment-form">
            <textarea placeholder="Write a comment..."></textarea>
            <button type="submit">Add Comment</button>
          </form>
        </section>
      </div>
  </div>
</body>

</html>